{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:21 2026-11-23 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:21 2026-11-23 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:21 2026-11-23 HKT</p><img alt=\"觀塘翠屏北邨翠楣樓揭發7歲男童被獨留在家。資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/da53117593311ab0c081e298d5b2fb3f/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20260102_171102397_06.jpg\"/><p>觀塘翠屏北邨翠楣樓一單位，今（23日）中午12時28分，一名女子報案，指她登門探訪其7歲兒子時，發現其分居丈夫不在單位內，兒子被獨留在家，警員及救護員接報到場，發現男童眼部紅腫，將他送往聯合醫院檢查。警方將案件列疏忽照顧，暫未有人被捕。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T07:31:53.235273+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T07:21:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T11:47:18.136215+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T07:25:24.258709+00:00","content_hash":"3e8750bd92f7e1f3cd407f8331d59eed7e9ca62069fc83b3cdce0fb68403b988","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}